   "lv": "kolay",
   "q": "<p>Zeynep made a pie chart to show how her family shares the household chores.</p>\n<div class=\"fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 520 240\" width=\"500\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Demir ailesinin ev işi paylaşımı pasta grafiği\">\n<text x=\"260\" y=\"16\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"bold\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#1e293b\">Who Does the Chores in the Demir Family?</text>\n<path d=\"M130,125 L130,30 A95,95 0 0,1 185.8,201.9 z\" fill=\"#f472b6\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<path d=\"M130,125 L185.8,201.9 A95,95 0 0,1 53.1,180.8 z\" fill=\"#60a5fa\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<path d=\"M130,125 L53.1,180.8 A95,95 0 0,1 53.1,69.2 z\" fill=\"#facc15\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<path d=\"M130,125 L53.1,69.2 A95,95 0 0,1 100.6,34.6 z\" fill=\"#34d399\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<path d=\"M130,125 L100.6,34.6 A95,95 0 0,1 130,30 z\" fill=\"#a78bfa\" stroke=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n<g font-size=\"12\" fill=\"#1e293b\">\n<rect x=\"290\" y=\"50\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#f472b6\"/><text x=\"314\" y=\"63\">Mom – 40%</text>\n<rect x=\"290\" y=\"80\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#60a5fa\"/><text x=\"314\" y=\"93\">Dad – 25%</text>\n<rect x=\"290\" y=\"110\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#facc15\"/><text x=\"314\" y=\"123\">Zeynep – 20%</text>\n<rect x=\"290\" y=\"140\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#34d399\"/><text x=\"314\" y=\"153\">Ozan (brother) – 10%</text>\n<rect x=\"290\" y=\"170\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#a78bfa\"/><text x=\"314\" y=\"183\">Grandma – 5%</text>\n</g></svg></div>\n<p>According to the chart, which of the following is <b>CORRECT</b>?</p>",
