   "q": "<p>Hi, I’m Kerem. I live with my parents and my twin sister. We all share the chores. I feed our parrot every morning and clean its cage twice a week. My sister does the laundry because she loves using the new washing machine. My dad cooks on weekdays. On Sundays, we all have lunch at a restaurant, so nobody cooks!</p>\n<p>Which of the following questions can <b>NOT</b> be answered according to the text?</p>",
