   "lv": "zor",
   "q": "<p>My brother and I share the kitchen chores. We take turns (1) ---- the dishes. I am responsible for (2) ---- the table and he is in charge of (3) ---- the rubbish.</p><p>Which of the following best completes the blanks?</p>",
