   "q": "<p>Pınar’s friends are coming at 4:30 p.m. At <b>2 p.m.</b> she starts the washing machine and immediately begins her other chores. She does one chore at a time.</p><table><caption>PINAR’S CHORES</caption><tr><th>Chore</th><th>Time</th></tr><tr><td>vacuum the living room</td><td>25 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>mop the kitchen floor</td><td>20 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>dust the shelves</td><td>15 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>clean the bathroom</td><td>30 minutes</td></tr><tr><td>hang out the washing</td><td>10 minutes</td></tr></table><div class=\"box\">The washing machine needs <b>100 minutes</b>. She can hang out the washing only after the machine finishes.</div><p>What is the earliest time Pınar can finish <b>all</b> of her chores?</p>",
